++- `cell_core.locating.JUDGED` is per read. **far: vertical, lateral, yaw.
++  near: vertical, lateral, pitch, yaw.** The far read still has to find the
++  right board. Its pitch is reported beside the judged worst case, never as it.
++  The near read is the one the pick uses.
