++| variant | in/far | in/near | out/far | out/near | mean z/Z | max \|rx\| |
++|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
++| base (DLSS + ACES) | +0.578 | +0.370 | +0.980 | +0.649 | +0.205 % | 0.641° |
++| base_lin | +0.133 | +0.120 | +0.668 | +0.523 | +0.116 % | 0.235° |
++| dlaa (aa/op 4) | +0.592 | +0.250 | +0.841 | +0.460 | +0.168 % | 0.527° |
++| dlaa + linear | +0.287 | +0.154 | +0.652 | +0.409 | +0.119 % | 0.603° |
++| noaa | −0.065 | +0.143 | +0.007 | +0.240 | +0.031 % | 1.266° |
++| noaa_lin | −0.103 | +0.066 | −0.088 | +0.156 | +0.007 % | 0.669° |
++| noaa + linear | −0.054 | +0.075 | −0.050 | +0.192 | +0.017 % | 0.668° |
++| **noaa + linear, _lin** | −0.125 | −0.127 | −0.077 | +0.154 | −0.012 % | **0.131°** |
++
++- DLAA does not help: it is still a temporal, learned resolve.
++- Auto exposure was already off (`/rtx/post/histogram/enabled` False).
++
++### 5.2 Full strict, 74 reads
++
++All candidates PASS 74/74.
++
++| candidate | far z mean / worst | near z mean / worst | far rx mean / sd / worst |
++|---|---|---|---|
++| original (DLSS + ACES) | +0.754 / +1.130 | +0.648 / +0.792 | +0.535 / 0.523 / 1.650° |
++| noaa | −0.010 / +0.156 | +0.199 / +0.250 | +0.963 / 0.383 / 1.323° |
++| noaa_lin | −0.099 / −0.174 | +0.117 / +0.175 | +0.391 / 0.363 / 0.742° |
++| noaa_linear | −0.052 / −0.139 | +0.148 / +0.214 | +0.479 / 0.273 / 0.777° |
