++## Notes
++
++**EAIK is installed locally.** This contradicted a standing assumption, and it
++was found by checking rather than believing the note. The local results reproduce
++the recorded host numbers exactly.
++
++**The generator applies one shelf-width margin to both racks.** The incoming
++shelf comes out ~16 mm wider than measured. That is conservative for collision
++but wrong for fidelity, and `unsupported()` reports it.
